<title>JAPAN: Toho Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toho Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    41.48		vs	   48.68</p>
<p> Operating	    8.84		vs	    9.26</p>
<p> Current		7.84		vs	    6.45</p>
<p> Net		    5.12		vs	    3.01</p>
<p> EPS		   22.74 yen	  vs	   13.36 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    225 million	  vs	 225 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toho Bank Ltd is a regional bank with Tohoku and Fukushima as business territory.</p>
